  "state_id": "S011",
  "navigation_state": "Find MAIB investigation analysis or conclusions about a comparable surface-vessel encounter. Conditions are not supplied. Own ship is underway. The traffic situation is a ship at relative bearing 0.0 degrees, heading 0.0 degrees at 3.02 knots, slowly closing, with projected CPA 0.0 metres and TCPA 5343.3 seconds. The decision question is whether tactical intervention is required, while preserving predictable course and speed when collision risk is not established. The OOW proposal under review is maintain_course with course change 0.0 degrees and target speed 0.0 knots. Prefer investigator findings over quoted regulations.",
