          "page": 14,
          "quote": "It is possible that he thought that this target was the one he had previously reported to the Master as having a CPA of 0.8 miles"
        },
        {
          "page": 14,
          "quote": "the information read was applied to HELLA and not WESTERN WINNER."
        },
        {
          "page": 14,
          "quote": "BRITISH TRENT was on a different course from when HELLA’s target was first acquired so that the CPA had changed to about 0.3 miles"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "P051",
      "investigator_finding": "Misclassification caused target motion analysis to overestimate Karen's speed and range; the subsequent close pass should have triggered reassessment.",
      "transferable_lesson": "Keep classification-dependent motion estimates provisional, and re-evaluate the solution when observed proximity contradicts it rather than dismissing the contact and moving on.",
